msgid ""
"Dash Platform answers carry a cryptographic proof. The Platform SDK in your "
"browser checks it against the public key of the validator quorum that signed"
" it, before Radar shows the figure. A node that answered can’t make a value "
"up: the check fails and Radar says so. Those figures are marked “Proof-"
"checked”, and the mark opens the proof inspector."
msgstr ""

